  "gt_steps": [
    "Turn on captions in the YouTube player.",
    "Play the video and use the YouTube captions to identify each emergency preparedness item and household consideration mentioned there.",
    "Switch to Sticky Notes.",
    "Write the items and considerations in a sticky note: `water`, `food`, `manual can opener`, `flashlight`, `extra batteries`, `weather radio`, `hand-cranked radio`, `first aid kit`, `diapers`, `infant formula`, `medicine bottles`, `children`, `pets`, `extra food`, `collapsible bowls`, `medicine`, `prescriptions`, `over-the-counter medications`."
